    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, ifuku daYehova hidikwinza diwakaanjana mukachi keyi yuma yeyi yakupupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami nakapompesha nyuza yejima kulonda yidasi njita naYerusalema. Mukala akawutambula, matala akayibuwa, ambanda akayishimba. Chibalu chamukala chakaya muwukoli, antu akashalahu hiyakayikisaŋana mumukalaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu Yehova wakedika nakulwa nanyuzoyu, neyi chalwiliyi hefuku danjita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu nyendu yindi yakemana hampidi yaOliveta, yekala kumesu aYerusalema kumusela, mpidi yaOliveta yakabaluka hakachi kayu chakutala kumusela nikumujika, kwikala nichinekineki cheneni nankashi; chibalu champidi chakaya kukabeta kakuchimunswa, chibalu nawa kukabeta kakuchidiilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwakatemukila kuchinekineki champidi jami, muloŋa chinekineki champidi chakashika nikuAzeli. Eŋa, mwakatemuka neyi chimwatemukili mutentanshi mumafuku amwanta wawaYuda Uziya. Yehova Nzambi yami wakenza, niakwakujila ejima akenza neyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu kucha hikwakekala kutooka hela kwiyilaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaŋa dakekala ifuku dimu delukawu kudi Yehova; himwaanaku, hiwufukuku. Ilaŋa kumelela kwakacha to-o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu meji amomi akafuma muYerusalema; chibalu chawu chakaya kukaluŋalwiji kakumusela, chibalu chawu nawa chakaya kukaluŋalwiji kakumujika. Chakekala choche nochu, nihamwaka wankanza, nihamwaka wachishika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wakekala Mwanta weseki dejima. Dena ifuku odu Yehova wakekala wumu, niijina dindi dimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituŋa dejima akadibalumuna neyi chana, kufumisha kuGeba nikuRimoni kukabeta kaYerusalema kakuchidiilu; Yerusalema wakanyamuka kwiwulu, wakashakama kuchipela chindi, kufumisha kuchisu chaBenjamini, ndo nikuchisu chakusambila, nikuchisu chakwiwombu, kufumisha nawa kukaposhi kaHananeli kushika nikumakamwinu avinyu yamwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakashakama antu, himwakekala nawa cheŋi ishiŋuku, Yerusalema wakashakama chakadi kwakama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chipupu chaketayi Yehova nyuza yejima yalwili naYerusalema. Nyijimba yawu yakanoŋa iku saŋa emenawu zululu, mesu awu akanoŋela muŋoma jamesu awu, madimi awu akanoŋela namutunwa twawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu mukachi kawu mwakekala muyoyu waweni wakufuma kudi Yehova; wejima wawu akela iwu akwata chikasa chamukwawu, iwu akwata chikasa chamukwawu, chikasa chaniwu hichikunyamukila chikasa chamukwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela Yuda nawa wakalwa naYerusalema; akapompesha hamu maheta anyuza yejima yanyeŋumukaku, niwuru, nisiliva, niyuma yakuvwala, yakasweja kuvula nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chipupu chakawana atuwalu, nawayingonŋavalu, nawanŋameli, nawayimbulu, nawanyama ejima akekala muyilombu oyu chakekala neyi chipupu ichi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuza yejima yakashala hanyuzoyu yenjili nakulwa naYerusalema, yakakandukaŋa hamwaka hamwaka nakudifukula kudi Mwanta, Yehova wamazaza, nakudya chawija chamuyisolu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisaka chahayisaka yahamaseki chakabula kukanduka kuYerusalema nakudifukula kudi Mwanta, Yehova wamazaza, hivakamona nvulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi chisaka chawaEjipitu, chabula kwikala nanvula, chakaleka kukanduka nakushikaku, niwena nawa akamona chipupu chakababeshayi nachu Yehova nyuza yabulaŋa kukanduka nakudya chawija chamuyisolu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenimu dimu mwakababeshelawu aEjipitu, dimu nawa mwakababeshelawu ninyuza yejima yabulaŋa kukanduka nakudya chawija chamuyisolu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu hangezu jawatuwalu akasonekahu nawu, Wajila waYehova; manuŋu amwitala daYehova akekala neyi yeŋa yakumesu akameŋa yakunama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena, manuŋu amuYerusalema namuYuda ejima, akekala ajila aYehova wamazaza. Antu ejima akaketulaŋa yimuna akenzaŋa nakuyinona nakutelekamu. Dena ifuku odu himwakekala nawa cheŋi kaKenanimwitala daYehova wamazazaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
